window.docContents[10].resolve({"/Airy-and-Related-Functions/Chapter-contents/#LMLF-___-DLMF-with-Lean--Airy-and-Related-Functions--Chapter-contents--Airy-functions":{"contents":"* 9.1 Special Notation* 9.2 Differential Equation* 9.3 Graphics* 9.4 Maclaurin Series* 9.5 Integral Representations* 9.6 Relations to Other Functions* 9.7 Asymptotic Expansions* 9.8 Modulus and Phase* 9.9 Zeros* 9.10 Integrals* 9.11 Products\n\n","context":"LMLF · DLMF with Lean\u0009Airy and Related Functions\u0009Chapter contents","header":"Airy functions","id":"/Airy-and-Related-Functions/Chapter-contents/#LMLF-___-DLMF-with-Lean--Airy-and-Related-Functions--Chapter-contents--Airy-functions"},"/Gamma-Function/___5___7-Series-Expansions/#LMLF-___-DLMF-with-Lean--Gamma-Function--___5___7-Series-Expansions--___5___7_LPAR_ii_RPAR_-Other-Series":{"contents":"When z\\ne0,-1,-2,\\ldots,\n\\psi(z)=-\\gamma-\\frac1z+\n\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{z}{k(k+z)}\n=-\\gamma+\n\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\left(\\frac1{k+1}-\\frac1{k+z}\\right).One numbered DLMF equation contains two convergent series. The Lean theorem therefore returns both\nHasSum statements together. The pole-avoidance hypothesis is written literally as exclusion of\nevery negative natural-number cast.\n\nUnder the same exclusion z\\ne0,-1,-2,\\ldots,\n\\psi\\!\\left(\\frac{z+1}{2}\\right)-\n\\psi\\!\\left(\\frac z2\\right)\n=2\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{(-1)^k}{k+z}.The factor 2 is included in each Lean summand, so the HasSum target is exactly the displayed\ndigamma difference.\n\nFor real y,\n\\Im\\psi(1+\\mathrm{i}y)=\n\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{y}{k^2+y^2}.This is a real series. Its sum is the imaginary part of Mathlib's complex digamma function at\n1 + i y; the shifted Lean index represents the source index beginning at k=1.\n\n","context":"LMLF · DLMF with Lean\u0009Gamma Function\u0009§5.7 Series Expansions","header":"§5.7(ii) Other Series","id":"/Gamma-Function/___5___7-Series-Expansions/#LMLF-___-DLMF-with-Lean--Gamma-Function--___5___7-Series-Expansions--___5___7_LPAR_ii_RPAR_-Other-Series"}});